    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Clingy Back-Spirit&quot; \u2013 A Short Horror Comedy Game Where You Exorcise the Haunted House's Curse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010 Please, Get Rid of the Evil Spirits! \u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple\u2014seal the haunted shrine with a sacred\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">Underwear</span><strong>\u00a0</strong>talisman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The problem? This place is so cursed it's practically an <strong>evil spirit theme park</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries\u2014you've got this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010 Ryuji Is Always With You! \u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your backseat ghost, Ryuji, is extremely sensitive to curses. Oh, and he's <strong>super clingy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to his <i>totally useless</i> ramblings\u2014you might just find a clue to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endings:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ How Did It Come to This? ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>star exorcist</strong> never rushes in the morning.<br>From the comfort of my <strong>85th-floor Tokyo high-rise</strong>, I casually glance at the stack of exorcism requests piled on my desk.<br>As always, my backseat ghost, <i>Ryuji</i>, picks out the <strong>safest-looking</strong> one.<br>He's a genius at finding easy jobs. And honestly? I'd rather avoid anything terrifying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Yawn\u2026 I slept well.</i><br>Anyway, today's lucky winner is\u2026 a <strong>haunted house</strong>?<br>Apparently, it was built for a high school cultural festival.<br>Alright, let's wrap this up <strong>quickly</strong> and go home\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026Wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Hey, Ryuji\u2026 isn\u2019t this place, like\u2026 <strong>WAY too cursed</strong>?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Disclaimer ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains <strong>jump scares and crude humor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>not responsible</strong> for any damages or unexpected consequences that occur while playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Clingy Spirit&quot;</strong> allows gameplay videos, live streaming, and monetization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission is required. <strong>Go for it!</strong></p>",
